Resources/themes/deskland/ contains the Beach (flat.html) and Meadow (meadow.html)
themes, their scripts and image assets from Deskland Preview; Resources/thumbs/beach.webp and
Resources/thumbs/meadow.webp are Deskland's theme thumbnails
(https://github.com/BLEZZ0102/Deskland, commit listed in UPSTREAM_COMMIT),
Copyright (C) 2026 Deskland authors, licensed under GPL-3.0. The files in that folder are
unmodified; Lichen provides a macOS host that speaks the same page protocol.

Resources/themes/patches/ contains Lichen's modifications to those themes, applied by the
host at runtime (for example beach.js, which keeps palm trees in place when an icon moves).
They are derived from Deskland Preview and licensed under GPL-3.0. The host also limits the
frame rate and resolution at which these pages render.

The field technique in Resources/themes/lichen/core.js follows Deskland's approach.

